                                                "sense_id": "b4aa61c7-6f3b-3266-9131-4002cfae56c9",
                                                "text": "Emilia 'tis true could use her clapper with great Dexterity, but he had the same advantages against her, which this had against him; Olimpia 's Tongue was also well hung but she ever had reason on her side, which he with reason could never either blame or oppose, and by both these came his Fortune: […]"
